      "patch": "@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@\n # Changes in HTMLDOC v1.9.12\n \n - Fixed a crash bug with \"data:\" URIs and EPUB output (Issue #410)\n-- Fixed a crach bug with bogus table attributes (Issue #417)\n+- Fixed crash bugs with bogus table attributes (Issue #416, Issue #417)\n - Fixed a crash bug with malformed URIs (Issue #418)\n - Fixed a crash bug with malformed GIF files (Issue #423)\n - Fixed some issues reported by Coverity."
    },
    {
      "sha": "85257e5f80e5e5d171dae436327e264e8156b58b",
      "filename": "htmldoc/ps-pdf.cxx",
      "status": "modified",
      "additions": 13,
      "deletions": 3,
